      "text": "[8:57PM] #Idumota #TrafficUpdate \n\nMovement from Tinubu Square connecting Nnamdi Azikiwe street enroute Tom Jones intersection is good at this hour.\n\nOyebanji roundabout connecting Adeniji Adele road through Oba's Palace and Police Post is looking good.\n\nIllubinrin connecting Carter Bridge inward journey Ijora olopa as well as Oyingbo is good.\n\nOther coverage areas remain calm and impediment free, while traffic officers are very much on ground managing traffic.\n\n#FollowLASTMA",
