      "twitterUrl": "https://twitter.com/followlastma/status/1948850888820310373",
      "text": "[9:58PM] #Ijanikin #TrafficUpdate \n\nThere is smooth vehicular movement from Abule Ado through Under Bridge, Volks, Afolabi Ege to Iyana Iba, though Iyana Iba intersection is busy due to commercial activities.\n\nTraffic from the intersection toward Igando through First Gate is okay, with slight congestion at Iyana School caused by commercial buses. Movement from Iyana School to Obadore Bridge and the return route is good.\n\nBadagry Expressway from Igbo Elerin Junction through Iyana Isashi and Iyana Era to Customs Checkpoint is flowing well.\n\nIn and out of Igbo Elerin is clear, and Afolabi Ege Flyover link to LASU-Isheri is also free.\n\n#FollowLASTMA",
